                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "5.2/10 - Beat-boxing + Birds + Basketball = About 30 minutes of fun.\n\nI had some fun with this game for sure, but overall it's too short and has too little polish to go crazy about it. The graphics are cute, and the beat box sounds were fun and the game itself takes some skill to master.  End of positives.\n\nI honestly wouldn't even pay the $1.99; more like a 99c game or whatever you value 30 minutes of time at. There are only 8 levels in campaign which can be completed in just half an hour. There is no achievements, cards, menu options or any of the final touches I like to see.\n\nLocal multiplayer is available; but I have never once utilized it. (in any game). If I did have friends and they wanted to play something locally it would be a much better game. So to highlight that element above others is weak.\n\nOverall, it's cool but only worth $0.50-0.99. 30 minutes of Game-play.\n\n[code][h1] Accidently Reviewed[/h1]\nHundreds of Reviews, Thousands of Members and FREE games for you! No Strings attached. Free Keys and Reviews weekly!  [Comeback Tour 2017 - 14]\n[url=http://steamcommunity.com/groups/Accidently] Steam Group: AccidentlyReviewed[/url][/code]\n\n",
